        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-CROSS-VM-POLYMORPHIC-91-95.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-CROSS-VM-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH91-PROOF-IMPORT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH92-MANIFOLD-INTER-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH93-HYBRID-GAIN-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH94-BYZANTINE-REJECT-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH95-SCSI-PARITY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-CROSS-PROOF-WITNESS      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CROSS-VM.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-CROSS-VM.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH91-PROOF-IMPORT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH92-MANIFOLD-INTER-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH93-HYBRID-GAIN-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH94-BYZANTINE-REJECT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH95-SCSI-PARITY-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-CROSS-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-CROSS-PROOF-WITNESS.
